<title>USA: Sioux City hogs off $1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs off $1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said trade was active. Compared with Thursday, barrows and gilts sold mostly $1.00 lower. Top $47.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3   220-270 lbs     47.00</p>
<p>		 270-280 lbs     46.50-47.00</p>
<p>    US 2-3   280-300 lbs     44.50-46.00</p>
<p>    US 3-4   300-330 lbs     43.00-44.00</p>
<p>Sows - off $1.00-2.00. Top $50.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3     300-400 lbs    42.00</p>
<p>		   400-450 lbs    43.00-44.00</p>
<p>		   450-500 lbs    45.00</p>
<p>		   500-550 lbs    47.00</p>
<p>		   550-700 lbs    50.00</p>
</text>
